 "summary": "Multi-unit Modbus server on the LG PI485 bus. Each configured indoor unit (AC, ventilation, DX kit or air-to-water) gets a 100-register block with control, temperatures, status and a 32-bit energy counter; registers 0..18 send commands to all units. Modbus RTU and Modbus TCP run together.",
